"\n<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"reading-progress\"><span id=\"reading-progress\"></span></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"route-curtain\" id=\"route-curtain\"><div class=\"curtain-brand\"><img src=\"/brand/showset-approved.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2389\" height=\"572\" decoding=\"async\"/></div></div>\n<header class=\"site-header\" id=\"site-header\">\n<div class=\"header-inner\">\n<a aria-label=\"SHOWSET home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\"><img class=\"approved-wordmark\" src=\"/brand/approved-wordmark.png\" alt=\"SHOWSET — events &amp; creative agency\" width=\"962\" height=\"250\"/></a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"desktop-navigation\">\n<a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"/events-experiences/\" data-route-key=\"events\">Events &amp; Experiences</a>\n<a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"/creative-design/\" data-route-key=\"creative\">Creative &amp; Design</a>\n<a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"/digital-marketing/\" data-route-key=\"digital\">Digital &amp; Marketing</a>\n<a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"/content-production/\" data-route-key=\"production\">Content &amp; Production</a>\n<a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"#studio\">Our studio</a><a class=\"nav-text\" href=\"#work\">Our work</a>\n</nav>\n<a class=\"header-cta\" href=\"#contact\">Let’s talk <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"round-icon\">↗</span></a>\n<button aria-controls=\"mobile-panel\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" class=\"mobile-toggle\" id=\"mobile-toggle\"><span></span><span></span></button>\n</div>\n</header>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobile-panel\" id=\"mobile-panel\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\"><a href=\"#home\">Home</a><a href=\"#events\">Events &amp; experiences</a><a href=\"#creative\">Creative &amp; design</a><a href=\"#digital\">Digital &amp; marketing</a><a href=\"#production\">Content &amp; production</a><a href=\"#studio\">Our studio</a><a href=\"#work\">Our work</a></nav>\n<div class=\"mobile-signature\">Big ideas. Every detail. Memorable experiences.</div>\n</div>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"view is-current\" data-view=\"home\">\n<!-- FIRST ACT: one strong image, no floating picture elements -->\n<section aria-label=\"SHOWSET introduction\" class=\"hero-track\" id=\"hero-track\">\n<div class=\"hero-stage\" id=\"hero-stage\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-ambient\"></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-photo\" id=\"hero-photo\"><img alt=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\" src=\"/concept-12/857bfe33201dcedbc6c9.webp\"/><div class=\"hero-photo-wash\"></div><div class=\"hero-photo-reflection\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"hero-foreground\" id=\"hero-foreground\">\n<h1 class=\"hero-title\"><span class=\"line\"><span>Great ideas</span></span><span class=\"line hero-accent-phrase\"><span>move people<span class=\"hero-period\">.</span></span></span></h1>\n<p>And they should go places. Into rooms. Across screens. Onto stages. Into the hands and heads of real people. We bring events and creative work together to make sure they do.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-links\"><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#services\">See what we do <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"text-arrow-link\" href=\"#studio\">Get to know us <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-second\" id=\"hero-second\" aria-hidden=\"true\" inert><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>An idea is a start.</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>We bring it to life.</span></span></h2><p class=\"hero-second-copy\">We take the good part of “what if?” and turn it into something you can actually experience. From the first sketch to the final detail, we connect the ideas, people and production that bring it to life.</p><div class=\"hero-second-links\"><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#services\">See what we do <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"text-arrow-link\" href=\"#studio\">Get to know us <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hero-graphic\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Editorial transition -->\n<section class=\"manifesto section-gutter\" id=\"discover\">\n<div class=\"manifesto-grid\">\n<div class=\"manifesto-heading-group\"><h2 class=\"section-title plain-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Too good to leave</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">on the drawing board.</span></h2><a class=\"understated-link\" href=\"#studio\">Meet the people behind it <span>↗</span></a></div>\n<div class=\"manifesto-copy\"><p>You know that feeling when an idea clicks and suddenly you can see the whole thing? We live for that part. But we love what happens next even more. The planning. The pixels. The people. The power cables. The tiny decisions nobody notices until they are done right. We connect creative thinking with the practical craft it takes to bring a concept into the world. So the work does more than look impressive. It feels right, behaves right and makes people want to be part of it.</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- THIRD ACT: full-frame scroll storyboard -->\n<section aria-label=\"From imagination to impact\" class=\"film-track\" id=\"film-track\">\n<div class=\"film-stage\" id=\"film-stage\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"film-images\">\n<div class=\"film-image is-on\" data-film-image=\"0\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/concept-12/857bfe33201dcedbc6c9.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"film-image\" data-film-image=\"1\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/concept-12/cacc0a760b075d1ccf18.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"film-image\" data-film-image=\"2\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"film-veil\"></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"film-gridline\"></div>\n<div class=\"film-story-inner\">\n<div class=\"film-steps\" id=\"film-steps\">\n<article class=\"film-step is-on\" data-film-step=\"0\"><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>First, we</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>imagine it.</span></span></h2><p>We get curious. Ask the awkwardly good questions. Pull things apart. Put unexpected things together. And find the idea worth chasing.</p></article>\n<article class=\"film-step\" data-film-step=\"1\"><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Then, we</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>make it happen.</span></span></h2><p>We design it, plan it, prototype it, build it and work through the bits nobody sees. This is where imagination meets the production schedule.</p></article>\n<article class=\"film-step\" data-film-step=\"2\"><h2 class=\"wipe-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Finally, we</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>move people.</span></span></h2><p>The doors open. The launch goes live. The audience leans in. Everything clicks into place and the idea stops being an idea.</p></article>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"film-progress\"><span class=\"film-progress-fill\" id=\"film-progress-fill\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- FEATURED STORIES: three-column, horizontally advancing case studies -->\n<section class=\"portfolio-section section-gutter\" id=\"portfolio-section\">\n<div class=\"portfolio-heading\"><h2 class=\"section-title block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>The thinking</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>behind the thing.</span></span></h2><div class=\"portfolio-intro\"><p>A little more than a final image. We like to show what makes an idea work: the intention, the atmosphere, the choices and the craft. Here are a few creative explorations that take you behind the scenes of how we think.</p></div></div>\n<div aria-label=\"Featured creative explorations\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" class=\"case-carousel\" id=\"case-carousel\" role=\"region\">\n<div aria-label=\"Featured case studies: drag, swipe or use arrow keys\" aria-live=\"off\" class=\"case-viewport case-rail\" id=\"case-rail\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<a aria-label=\"Explore creative study: Atmosphere is everything\" class=\"case-slide is-active\" data-case-slide=\"0\" href=\"#case-events\">\n<div class=\"case-photo\"><img alt=\"Warm, beautifully lit outdoor event scene\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/evening.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"case-story\"><h3>Atmosphere is everything<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h3><p>You can plan the programme. The feeling is what makes people stay.</p><span class=\"case-slide-link\">Explore the study <b>↗</b></span></div>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Explore creative study: Made to be remembered\" class=\"case-slide\" data-case-slide=\"1\" href=\"#case-identity\">\n<div class=\"case-photo\"><img alt=\"SHOWSET creative identity and designed brand materials\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/cases/identity-hero.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"case-story\"><h3>Made to be remembered<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h3><p>Identity is built in a thousand little encounters, not one big reveal.</p><span class=\"case-slide-link\">Explore the study <b>↗</b></span></div>\n</a>\n<a aria-label=\"Explore creative study: Behind every moment\" class=\"case-slide\" data-case-slide=\"2\" href=\"#case-production\">\n<div class=\"case-photo\"><img alt=\"Hands adjusting sound equipment during event production\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/cases/production-hero.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"case-story\"><h3>Behind every moment<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h3><p>The quiet precision that makes a big production feel effortless.</p><span class=\"case-slide-link\">Explore the study <b>↗</b></span></div>\n</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- FOURTH ACT: a single visual focus, services are not cards -->\n\n<section aria-label=\"Explore our four service categories\" class=\"services-track\" id=\"services-track\">\n<div class=\"services-stage\">\n<div class=\"services-left\">\n<div class=\"services-stage-intro\" id=\"services\">\n<h2 class=\"services-panel-heading\"><span>Different disciplines<span class=\"service-heading-period\">.</span></span><span class=\"accent-text\">One connected team.</span></h2>\n<p>A launch might need an identity. An event might need a digital home. A campaign might need a film, a space or a piece of technology to make it work. We move between all four worlds so the idea stays in one piece.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-navigation\">\n<a class=\"discipline is-on\" data-service=\"0\" href=\"#events\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Events &amp; experiences</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"discipline\" data-service=\"1\" href=\"#creative\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Creative &amp; design</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"discipline\" data-service=\"2\" href=\"#digital\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Digital &amp; marketing</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n<a class=\"discipline\" data-service=\"3\" href=\"#production\"><span class=\"discipline-name\">Content &amp; production</span><span class=\"discipline-arrow\">↗</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"services-right\" id=\"services-right\">\n<div class=\"service-visual is-on\" data-service-visual=\"0\"><img alt=\"Atmospheric outdoor event with warm lights\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"service-visual\" data-service-visual=\"1\"><img alt=\"Carefully designed SHOWSET brand materials\" src=\"/concept-12/7f12ec7b20911ecee355.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"service-visual service-digital\" data-service-visual=\"2\"><div class=\"digital-stage\"><div class=\"digital-screen\"><div class=\"digital-top\"><span>showset<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></span></div><div class=\"digital-type\">THE NEXT<br/><em>BIG THING<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></em></div><div class=\"digital-bottom\"><span>Ideas with purpose.</span></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"service-visual\" data-service-visual=\"3\"><img alt=\"Hands on a professional sound mixing desk\" src=\"/concept-12/aa01c56d7f9e7726002f.webp\"/></div>\n<div class=\"service-image-overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"service-image-information\"><p id=\"service-visual-copy\">We imagine, produce and deliver experiences that bring people together.</p><a aria-label=\"Explore Events &amp; experiences\" href=\"#events\" id=\"service-visual-link\">Step inside this world <span>↗</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- ORIGINAL V2 TREATMENT: the single teal dot grows to fill the view -->\n<section aria-label=\"SHOWSET approach\" class=\"dot-track\" id=\"dot-track\">\n<div class=\"dot-stage\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"dot-core\" id=\"dot-core\"></div>\n<div class=\"dot-words\"><h2>Serious about the <em>details.</em><br/>Wild about the <em>possibilities<span>.</span></em></h2><p>The small stuff is never small when you are making something big.</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"end-section section-gutter\" id=\"ending\"><h2 class=\"section-title plain-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Got a beautifully</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">complicated idea?</span></h2><div class=\"end-bottom\"><p>The brief can be polished, half-written or still living entirely in your head. Tell us what you are trying to make happen. We know where to start.</p><a class=\"solid-link end-link\" href=\"#contact\">Let’s make a plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section>\n</div>\n<!-- Dynamic service page, each category has its own route -->\n<div class=\"view\" data-view=\"service\">\n<section class=\"category-hero\" id=\"category-hero\"><div class=\"category-bg\"><img alt=\"\" data-depth-image=\"\" id=\"category-image\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div><div class=\"category-gradient\"></div><div class=\"category-inner\"><h1 class=\"block-heading\" id=\"category-title\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Events &amp;</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>experiences.</span></span></h1><p id=\"category-description\">The room. The crowd. The goosebumps. The perfectly timed reveal. We bring bold ideas and meticulous planning together to turn gatherings into experiences.</p><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#contact\">Plan something brilliant <span>↗</span></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"category-detail section-gutter\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\" id=\"category-belief\">It's about how it feels.</h2><div class=\"category-detail-bottom\"><p id=\"category-belief-copy\"></p></div><div class=\"category-clusters\"><div class=\"category-clusters-title\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">How we bring it together.</h2><p>Different parts. One connected idea.</p></div><div class=\"cluster-grid\" id=\"category-clusters\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"category-feature\" id=\"category-feature\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\" id=\"category-feature-title\"></h2><p id=\"category-feature-copy\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"category-process\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">From the first thought to the final detail.</h2><div class=\"process-grid\" id=\"category-process-list\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"category-capabilities\"><div class=\"category-capabilities-head\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Explore the possibilities.</h2><p>More ways we can help, depending on your brief.</p></div><div class=\"capabilities-list\" id=\"category-capabilities-list\"></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"category-banner\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"category-banner\" src=\"/concept-12/cacc0a760b075d1ccf18.webp\"/><div class=\"category-banner-shade\"></div><div><h2 class=\"block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Let's make</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>it memorable<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></span></span></h2><a class=\"solid-link\" href=\"#contact\">Bring us your brief <span>↗</span></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"category-more section-gutter\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Keep exploring<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h2><div id=\"category-more-links\"></div></section>\n</div>\n<!-- Supporting pages -->\n<div class=\"view editorial-page\" data-view=\"studio\">\n<section class=\"simple-hero studio-hero editorial-hero\"><div class=\"simple-bg\"><img src=\"/media/planning.webp\" alt=\"Creative planning and production details\" data-depth-image=\"\"/></div><div class=\"simple-shade\"></div><div class=\"simple-hero-content\"><h1 class=\"block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>Curious minds.</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>Capable hands<span class=\"hero-period\">.</span></span></span></h1><p>We ask big questions, make ambitious plans and care a slightly unreasonable amount about the finishing touches.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"studio-copy studio-manifesto section-gutter\"><div class=\"studio-manifesto-layout\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise studio-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">We like our ideas</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">out in the wild<span class=\"service-period\">.</span></span></h2><div class=\"studio-manifesto-body\"><p>We are not interested in good ideas that only look good in presentations. We want them out in the world, doing what they were made to do. Drawing a crowd. Starting a conversation. Making something easier. Giving a brand a point of view. Making a room feel different.</p><p>That is why we connect events and creative thinking under one roof. Strategy, design, digital, production and the people who make it all happen belong in the same conversation. One idea can become many things without losing its personality along the way.</p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"studio-exploration section-gutter\" aria-label=\"How our thinking becomes real\"><div class=\"studio-exploration-intro\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise studio-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">What starts as a thought</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">becomes something real<span class=\"service-period\">.</span></span></h2><p>From the first question to the last detail, our work moves between imagination, craft and people. Select a thought to see another side of the story.</p></div><div class=\"studio-exploration-layout\">\n<div class=\"studio-story-visual\" data-studio-visual aria-hidden=\"true\"><figure class=\"studio-story-frame is-active\" data-studio-frame=\"0\" data-active=\"true\"><img src=\"/media/planning.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"/></figure><figure class=\"studio-story-frame\" data-studio-frame=\"1\" data-active=\"false\"><img src=\"/media/details.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"/></figure><figure class=\"studio-story-frame\" data-studio-frame=\"2\" data-active=\"false\"><img src=\"/media/rigging.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"/></figure><div class=\"studio-story-visual-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"studio-story-choices\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Explore our approach\"><div class=\"studio-story-entry is-active\" data-studio-entry=\"0\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"studio-story-choice\" data-studio-choice=\"0\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span>Ask better questions.</span><span class=\"studio-story-choice-indicator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><p>A good brief is the beginning, not the boundary. We dig a little deeper to find the idea worth making.</p></div><div class=\"studio-story-entry\" data-studio-entry=\"1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"studio-story-choice\" data-studio-choice=\"1\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>Make the idea tangible.</span><span class=\"studio-story-choice-indicator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><p>From a tiny detail on screen to a room full of people, we bring the same care to the craft.</p></div><div class=\"studio-story-entry\" data-studio-entry=\"2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"studio-story-choice\" data-studio-choice=\"2\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span>Make it mean something.</span><span class=\"studio-story-choice-indicator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button><p>The best outcome is not just something beautiful. It is something people feel, use or remember.</p></div></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"studio-partnership studio-outlook section-gutter\"><div class=\"studio-outlook-heading\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise studio-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">One brief. Fewer handovers.</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">Better conversations<span class=\"service-period\">.</span></span></h2></div><div class=\"studio-partnership-body\"><p>Some ideas need a whole mix of disciplines. Others need one good specialist brain. We bring events, design, digital and production into the same conversation and build the team around what the brief actually needs. Connected thinking. Clear decisions. Details in good hands.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"studio-final editorial-ending section-gutter\"><div class=\"studio-final-inner\"><div><h2 class=\"soft-rise studio-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">We should probably</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">meet<span class=\"service-period\">.</span></span></h2><div class=\"studio-final-copy\"><p>Tell us what you have in mind. We will bring the curiosity, the ideas and the practical thinking.</p></div><a class=\"solid-link editorial-action\" href=\"/contact/\">Come say hello <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></section>\n</div><div class=\"view editorial-page\" data-view=\"work\">\n<section class=\"simple-hero work-hero editorial-hero\"><div class=\"simple-bg\"><img src=\"/media/rigging.webp\" alt=\"Event production and lighting scene\" data-depth-image=\"\"/></div><div class=\"simple-shade\"></div><div class=\"simple-hero-content\"><h1 class=\"block-heading\"><span class=\"wipe-line\"><span>The story is</span></span><span class=\"wipe-line accent-line\"><span>in the making<span class=\"hero-period\">.</span></span></span></h1><p>The polished final frame is only part of it. We are interested in the decisions that made it possible, the thinking that gave it shape and the feeling it leaves behind.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"work-page-intro section-gutter\"><div class=\"work-editorial-note\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise work-intro-title\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Creative explorations.</span></h2><div class=\"work-intro-copy\"><p>Three creative studies, three different ways of looking at a brief. These are explorations of atmosphere, identity and production, not completed client projects. The thinking is real. The possibilities are open.</p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"work-page-gallery section-gutter\" aria-label=\"Creative studies\"><div class=\"case-index\"><a class=\"case-index-item work-feature\" href=\"/work/atmosphere-is-everything/\"><div class=\"case-index-image\"><img src=\"/media/evening.webp\" alt=\"Atmosphere is everything creative study\" loading=\"lazy\" data-depth-image=\"\"/></div><div class=\"case-index-info\"><div class=\"work-feature-top\"><span class=\"work-feature-type\">Creative study</span><span class=\"work-feature-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Atmosphere is everything<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h2><p>A room is never just a room. The arrival, the lighting, the sound and the unexpected little detail all have something to say.</p><span class=\"work-feature-discover\">Explore the story <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></div></a><a class=\"case-index-item work-feature\" href=\"/work/made-to-be-remembered/\"><div class=\"case-index-image\"><img src=\"/media/cases/identity-hero.webp\" alt=\"Made to be remembered creative study\" loading=\"lazy\" data-depth-image=\"\"/></div><div class=\"case-index-info\"><div class=\"work-feature-top\"><span class=\"work-feature-type\">Creative study</span><span class=\"work-feature-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Made to be remembered<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h2><p>A brand gets built every time someone meets it. One voice, many touchpoints, a thousand tiny clues.</p><span class=\"work-feature-discover\">Explore the story <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></div></a><a class=\"case-index-item work-feature\" href=\"/work/behind-every-moment/\"><div class=\"case-index-image\"><img src=\"/media/cases/production-hero.webp\" alt=\"Behind every moment creative study\" loading=\"lazy\" data-depth-image=\"\"/></div><div class=\"case-index-info\"><div class=\"work-feature-top\"><span class=\"work-feature-type\">Creative study</span><span class=\"work-feature-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></div><h2 class=\"soft-rise\">Behind every moment<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h2><p>The best production looks effortless because so much of the effort happened before the doors opened.</p><span class=\"work-feature-discover\">Explore the story <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span></div></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"work-final editorial-ending section-gutter\"><div class=\"work-final-inner\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise studio-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">What should we</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">make next<span class=\"service-period\">?</span></span></h2><p class=\"work-final-copy\">A story worth telling, a space worth stepping into, an idea worth getting people excited about. Tell us where to begin.</p><a class=\"solid-link editorial-action\" href=\"/contact/\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section>\n</div><div class=\"view\" data-view=\"case-study\">\n<section class=\"case-detail-hero\"><div class=\"case-detail-photo\"><img alt=\"\" data-depth-image=\"\" id=\"case-detail-image\" src=\"/concept-12/900abdb6d28df2c511ea.webp\"/></div><div class=\"case-detail-wash\"></div><div class=\"case-detail-header section-gutter\"><h1 id=\"case-detail-title\">Atmosphere is everything<span class=\"teal-dot\">.</span></h1><p id=\"case-detail-intro\"></p></div></section>\n<section class=\"case-detail-body section-gutter\"><div class=\"case-detail-introduction\"><h2 class=\"soft-rise\" id=\"case-detail-belief\"></h2><p id=\"case-detail-description\"></p></div><blockquote class=\"case-quote\" id=\"case-detail-quote\"></blockquote><div class=\"case-detail-visual\"><img alt=\"Creative process imagery\" data-depth-image=\"\" id=\"case-detail-second-image\" src=\"/concept-12/f778ffc756368369e22f.webp\"/></div><div class=\"case-detail-next\"><p>A good idea deserves a good ending. What could yours become?</p><a class=\"understated-link\" href=\"#contact\">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></div></section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"view\" data-view=\"contact\">\n<section class=\"contact-view contact-refined section-gutter\" aria-label=\"Start a conversation with SHOWSET\">\n <div class=\"contact-shell\">\n  <div class=\"contact-left\">\n   <div class=\"contact-intro\">\n    <h1 class=\"plain-heading contact-editorial-heading\"><span class=\"plain-line\">Something</span><span class=\"plain-line accent-text\">brewing<span class=\"service-period\">?</span></span></h1>\n    <p>Big idea, rough sketch or something you haven't quite figured out? We're listening.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"contact-photo\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <img src=\"/media/planning.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"eager\"/>\n    <span class=\"contact-photo-line\"></span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <form class=\"contact-form\" id=\"contact-form\" novalidate=\"false\">\n   <div class=\"contact-form-head\">\n    <h2>Tell us the interesting bit.</h2>\n    <p>You bring the idea. We'll help work out the details.</p>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"contact-two-fields\">\n    <div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"full-name\">Your name <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input autocomplete=\"name\" id=\"full-name\" name=\"name\" placeholder=\"What should we call you?\" maxlength=\"120\" required=\"\"/></div>\n    <div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"email\">Email address <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input autocomplete=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Somewhere we can reach you\" maxlength=\"254\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"project-type\">What are we making?</label>\n    <div class=\"custom-select\" id=\"project-combobox\">\n     <select class=\"native-select-fallback\" id=\"project-type\" name=\"type\">\n      <option value=\"\">Choose the closest fit</option>\n      <option>An event or experience</option><option>A brand or design project</option><option>A website or digital solution</option><option>Marketing and content</option><option>Film or production</option><option>A bit of everything</option><option>Not quite sure yet</option>\n     </select>\n     <button aria-controls=\"project-options\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"What are we making?\" class=\"select-trigger\" id=\"project-trigger\" role=\"combobox\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"select-value\">Choose the closest fit</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\"><path d=\"m2.5 4.5 3.5 3.5 3.5-3.5\"></path></svg></button>\n     <div aria-label=\"Project type\" class=\"select-panel\" id=\"project-options\" role=\"listbox\">\n      <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"An event or experience\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">An event or experience</button>\n      <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"A brand or design project\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">A brand or design project</button>\n      <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"A website or digital solution\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">A website or digital solution</button>\n      <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"Marketing and content\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">Marketing and content</button>\n      <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"Film or production\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">Film or production</button>\n      <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"A bit of everything\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">A bit of everything</button>\n      <button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"select-option\" data-value=\"Not quite sure yet\" role=\"option\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">Not quite sure yet</button>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"contact-field contact-message\"><label for=\"message\">Tell us about it <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" placeholder=\"The idea, the challenge, the wonderfully complicated bits. Start anywhere.\" required=\"\" maxlength=\"5000\" rows=\"5\"></textarea></div>\n   <div class=\"contact-options-intro\"><span>One or two useful details, if you have them.</span></div>\n   <div class=\"contact-optional-fields\">\n    <div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"company\">Company or organisation <span class=\"optional-mark\">Optional</span></label><input autocomplete=\"organization\" id=\"company\" name=\"company\" placeholder=\"If there is one\" maxlength=\"160\"/></div>\n    <div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"project-date\">Timing <span class=\"optional-mark\">Optional</span></label><input id=\"project-date\" name=\"date\" placeholder=\"Whenever you're ready\" maxlength=\"120\"/></div>\n    <div class=\"contact-field\"><label for=\"project-budget\">Budget <span class=\"optional-mark\">Optional</span></label><input id=\"project-budget\" name=\"budget\" placeholder=\"A ballpark is fine\" maxlength=\"120\"/></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"contact-honeypot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label for=\"contact-website\">Leave this blank</label><input id=\"contact-website\" name=\"website\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"/></div>\n   <div class=\"contact-submit-area\">\n    <button class=\"solid-link contact-submit\" type=\"submit\">Prepare the email <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button>\n    <p class=\"form-note\">You don't need all the answers. This opens your email app, where you can review and send your message.</p>\n   </div>\n   <p class=\"form-result\" id=\"form-result\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n  </form>\n </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"contact-direct section-gutter\" aria-label=\"Get in touch directly\">\n <div class=\"contact-direct-inner\">\n  <div class=\"contact-direct-heading\"><h2 class=\"plain-heading\">More of a talker<span class=\"service-period\">?</span></h2><p>Not every conversation needs to start with a form.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"contact-direct-links\">\n   <a class=\"contact-direct-link\" data-contact-email href=\"mailto:hello@showset.co.za\"><span class=\"contact-direct-caption\">Drop us a line</span><span class=\"contact-direct-value\">hello@showset.co.za</span><span class=\"contact-direct-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n   <a class=\"contact-direct-link\" data-contact-phone href=\"tel:+27682805777\"><span class=\"contact-direct-caption\">Give us a call</span><span class=\"contact-direct-value\">+27 68 280 5777</span><span class=\"contact-direct-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"footer-head\"><div class=\"footer-identity\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\"><img class=\"approved-wordmark\" src=\"/brand/approved-wordmark.png\" alt=\"SHOWSET — events &amp; creative agency\" width=\"962\" height=\"250\"/></a><p>We think it through. We make it happen.<br/>We make it feel like something.</p></div><div class=\"footer-links\"><div><span>DISCOVER</span><a href=\"#home\">Home</a><a href=\"#studio\">Our studio</a><a href=\"#work\">Our work</a><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></div><div><span>WHAT WE DO</span><a href=\"#events\">Events &amp; experiences</a><a href=\"#creative\">Creative &amp; design</a><a href=\"#digital\">Digital &amp; marketing</a><a href=\"#production\">